flowchart TD
    U([User]) --> ST[Streamlit UI<br/>:8501]
    ST -->|check emails<br/>correct labels<br/>inspect memory| API[FastAPI Backend<br/>:8000]

    API -->|fetch unseen| IMAP[Gmail IMAP]
    API -->|send replies| SMTP[Gmail SMTP]

    API --> AG

    subgraph AG[LangGraph Agent]
        TR[Triage Router<br/>GPT-4o-mini] -->|ignore| IGN[Log & skip]
        TR -->|notify| NTF[Notify user]
        TR -->|respond| RA[Response Agent<br/>GPT-4o ReAct]
        RA --> DR[Draft reply]
        DR --> SEND[Send via SMTP]
    end

    subgraph MEM[Qdrant Memory Store]
        SEM[(Semantic<br/>contacts · preferences)]
        EPI[(Episodic<br/>corrected examples)]
        PRO[(Procedural<br/>triage rules)]
    end

    TR <-->|read rules + examples| MEM
    RA <-->|read/write facts| SEM

    COR[User Correction] --> EPI
    COR --> OPT[Prompt Optimizer<br/>Claude / GPT-4o]
    OPT -->|rewrite rules| PRO

    classDef ui fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#b58900,color:#4a3b00,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef api fill:#d9edf7,stroke:#31708f,color:#12384a,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef agent fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b4332,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef mem fill:#fde2e4,stroke:#c1121f,color:#5f0f13,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef ext fill:#efe3ff,stroke:#7b2cbf,color:#3c096c,stroke-width:2px;

    class U,ST ui;
    class API api;
    class TR,RA,DR,SEND,IGN,NTF,AG agent;
    class SEM,EPI,PRO,MEM mem;
    class IMAP,SMTP,OPT,COR ext;
